Additional considerations

Either display_name or at least one entry in names must be provided. If display_name is absent, it is computed automatically from the first available name.
display_name_variants is optional. Use it when the person is known under multiple forms of their name (e.g. birth name alongside married name, or initials).
A person may have multiple names entries — use one entry per distinct name form (birth name, married name, pseudonym).
Identifier types: local (institutional login or employee id), orcid, idref, idhals (HAL login), idhali (HAL numeric id), scopus.
memberships.entity_uid must reference a research structure already known to IKG, using either the local-&lt;id&gt; format or an external identifier prefix such as uai-&lt;code&gt;.
employments.entity_uid references an institution. The position.code must be a valid HCERES position code (e.g. PR, MCF, DR, CR, IR, Post-doc).
external: true marks people who are not managed by the institution (e.g. co-authors discovered through publication harvesting). External people carry no memberships or employments.

